; --- Boss bone skeleton ---------------------------------------------------
; Retargeted to the cartoon boss (assets/boss2). main.gd's _build_cutout_boss()
; hangs one sliced Sprite2D under each bone, so rotating a bone moves that limb
; piece. Joint positions map to the sliced art via
;   rig = 41.55 + base_x * 1.23431   and   60 + base_y * 1.23431
